  My Recommendation

  The Figma Community options (1-4, 7-9) are the best starting point because:
  - They're free and you can open them directly in Figma
  - You can inspect exact colors, spacing, typography, and components
  - They're editable — you can adapt them to your M3 dark theme with green seed color
  - I can capture exact design tokens from screenshots you share

  Best combo: Open #1 (Cricket Live Score) + #7 (Scora) in Figma. The cricket one gives you domain-specific patterns, and Scora gives you a   
  polished dark theme system with 134 screens.